---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const rootPath = baseUrl.endsWith("/") ? baseUrl : `${baseUrl}/`;
const policyLinks = [
  { href: `${rootPath}about`, label: "소개" },
  { href: `${rootPath}privacy`, label: "개인정보처리방침" },
  { href: `${rootPath}terms`, label: "이용약관·면책" },
  { href: `${rootPath}contact`, label: "연락처" },
];
---

<footer class="mt-10 border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-8 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-4">
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      면책: 본 사이트의 모든 내용은 개인 블로그의 투자 참고 메모이며, 투자 손익의 책임은 읽는 분 본인에게 있습니다.
      자세한 내용은
      <a href={`${rootPath}terms`} class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">이용약관·면책조항</a>을 확인하세요.
    </p>
    <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-1 gap-y-1" aria-label="정책 및 소개">
      {
        policyLinks.map((link) => (
          <a href={link.href} class="md-btn-text !min-h-8 !px-2 text-sm">
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
    <p>
      문의:
      <a href="mailto:contact@ziin.ai" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">contact@ziin.ai</a>
      ·
      <a href={`${rootPath}contact`} class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">연락처 페이지</a>
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant/80">© {new Date().getFullYear()} ziin.ai</p>
  </div>
</footer>
